WEBVTT

00:08:59.714 --> 00:09:01.100
S velikom sam preciznošću

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.159
zapravo uspio nekidan napraviti ovu

00:09:03.159 --> 00:09:04.708
veoma dražesnu patkicu.

00:09:10.083 --> 00:09:11.927
Ali zapitao sam se

00:09:11.927 --> 00:09:18.840
kako bi ljudi koji postavljaju bombe na sebe

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:19.921
i dižu se u zrak,

00:09:19.921 --> 00:09:23.678
mogli iskoristiti 3D printere.

00:09:23.678 --> 00:09:27.791
Možda na ovaj način.

00:09:27.791 --> 00:09:29.984
Vidite, ukoliko možete printati metal,

00:09:29.984 --> 00:09:33.331
možete isprintati jedan ovakav